@WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5029

### Register
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/UsersWebApi
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailAddress": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "Password1!",
  "phoneNumber": "+123456789"
}

###

### Sign in (password grant — development/testing until the React BFF exists)
# @name signIn
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username=jane@example.com&password=Password1!&client_id=nine-resource-owner&scope=openid email profile offline_access api

> {%
client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token);
%}

###

### Current account
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###
